    (uuid "ca28736c-7f17-5a9e-9b5d-b48bfaacdb68"))
  (text "What this does: test points on key nets not served elsewhere, in three sizes (D-22Nov.9). Silkscreen: TP number only.\nBlack Keystone 5011 loops on GND at the board edges; orange Keystone 5003 loops where a probe stays clipped on\n(rails, GNSS PPS); 1.0 mm round pads for nets you only touch. Each joins its net by global label.\nNo test point on a fire net or on a line that drives a fire switch: OUTPUTx_HIGH / LOW, PYROx_ENERGY, the armed rails,\nPYROx_FIRE / GATE / LS_SELECT, STAGE_ELIGIBLE, PYRO3_HS_ENABLE (B-02). Their scaled ADC nodes are under PYRO DIAGNOSTICS."
    (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 15.24 25.4 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "c75cdf50-37a6-565c-acd4-1248b48f1b52"))
